    description: "Found by the 2026-10-31 docstring staleness audit (dev 5f6b2af921): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10312026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. linkers/build_target.py:93 `target_path.lstrip('./')`; normpath on the next line already handles ./. Under crates/app/Cargo.toml, ./.bin/main.rs -> crates/app/bin/main.rs and ./../shared/main.rs -> crates/app/shared/main.rs. v08."  # 9912
